%% GitHub Advanced Search MCP — Unified Architecture
flowchart TB
    subgraph Interfaces["Interface Layer"]
        CLI["CLI\n(gh-search)"]
        API["HTTP API\n(gh-search serve)"]
        MCP["MCP Server\n(gh-search-mcp)"]
        Web["Web UI\n(Next.js)"]
    end

    subgraph Core["Rust Core (gh-search-core)"]
        Client["GitHubSearchClient"]
        Features["Regex Expander\n+ Result Clustering\n+ LLM helpers"]
        Queue["SmartRequestQueue\n(rate-limit & caching brain)"]
        Cache["Shared Disk Cache"]
    end

    CLI --> Client
    API --> Client
    MCP --> Client
    Web -->|HTTP| API
    API --> Web

    Client --> Features
    Features --> Queue
    Queue --> Cache
    Cache --> Client

    Queue -->|"GitHub REST / GraphQL"| GitHub[(GitHub API)]
    GitHub --> Queue

    Client -->|Search responses| CLI
    Client -->|JSON & streaming| API
    Client -->|StdIO tool| MCP
